{"candidate_identity":"1aff1e5c4c327730507e8f99a5f4c4f61888f8c40b6fed6a35ada15922676785","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3e92e59957ec2e4dfd7bd075587452532be51d4b655e9dacef8f5371f6e50cd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4377519e2a63faf33a2e769edaa61c56f9ab2f991aa65f35d4b3384f98bd73b2","logical_entry_identity":"cfe6699653443226af3a55d34ce7983af192014edb51322f60c83ac811411f35","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You stand in the way of magical damage. That which does not kill you will make you stronger.\n\t\tWhen you are hit by hostile non-physical, non-mind damage you gain %d%% resistance to that element for 7 turns.\n\t\tAt talent level 3, the bonus resistance may apply to 3 elements, refreshing the duration with each element added.\n\t\tAdditionally, each time you take non-physical, non-mind damage, your equilibrium will decrease and stamina increase by %0.2f.\n\t\tThe effects will increase with the greater of your Mindpower or Physical power and the bonus resistance can be a mental crit.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你选择了站在魔法的对立面。那些未能杀死你的磨难将使你更加强大。\n\t\t每次你从敌对目标那里受到一种非物理、非精神时，你能增加 %d%% 对该类型伤害的抗性，持续 7 回合。\n\t\t在技能等级 3 时，你可以获得对 3 种类型的抗性，每增加一种类型时都会刷新持续时间。\n\t\t此外，每当你被非物理，非精神伤害击中时，你会降低 %0.2f 失衡值并增加等量体力值。\n\t\t技能效果受精神或物理强度较高者加成。\n\t\t抗性加成效果可以触发精神暴击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b2e7106504b130af711557e3122fec2dc27756da04b4b1b1e4360e3b12690ef","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"437ca195f894df1c9b636b9a3f9e446cf0ddb0325741b7788b055e291434c94f","logical_entry_identity":"9fcd1a20d2b5660f92e51faa0bcf61b06d1a689b70c93123b288c8dde5f97495","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"cold spot","source_tag":"_t","target":"寒冷地点"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42cfcff5b22cada481befe568cedb1c31b9a632b4e6bbda1f6ebbfdec87244b5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4385d33cc0f74b5d4bce1eef61205ba7e4a718a101fa38286d26f12dc12a13ab","logical_entry_identity":"825a7d